JavaScript example programs
===========================

These are the example programs from the book "Programming in JavaScript",
which is in the Manuals directory on the hard disc (double-click
Manuals.JSTutor.Start/htm to read it).

Double-click a program to run it. To read or change one, Shift-double-click
it: it opens in Edit. Save your changed copies somewhere of your own (for
example a directory called MyProgs on the hard disc) so you can always come
back to the originals.

Each program is listed in the chapter that explains it.
